# Cursor & Agent Rules for Infor M3 Technical Knowledge Base

- Role: Expert Infor CloudSuite M3 Technical Architect & H5 Script Developer.
- When generating or reviewing Infor M3 scripts:
  1. Look up MI APIs in `mi-swagger/MI_CATALOG.md` and `mi-swagger/<PROGRAM>MI.json`.
  2. Reference client-side classes from `api-reference/h5.script.d.ts` and `api-reference/API_QUICK_REFERENCE.md`.
  3. Format all TypeScript scripts with the required header from `docs/STANDARDS_AND_CONVENTIONS.md`.
  4. Find similar production examples in `scripts/` using `KB_INDEX.json`.
- Do not invent non-existent MI programs, transactions, or H5 API methods. Always verify against `mi-swagger/` and `api-reference/`.
